        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Whit Stillman, Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, Analeigh Tipton, Taylor Nichols\n- Works: Damsels in Distress, Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco\n- Topics: American film, acting, filmmaking\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Nichols was born as Cecil Taylor Nichols on March 3, 1959, in Louisville, Kentucky.\n- Greta Gerwig was born as Greta Celeste Gerwig on August 4, 1983.\n- Greta Gerwig is an American actress and filmmaker.\n- Damsels in Distress is an American comedy film written and directed by Whit Stillman.\n- Damsels in Distress had the original titles Violet Wister's Damsels in Distress and Whit Stillman's Damsels in Distress.\n- Damsels in Distress stars Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, and Analeigh Tipton.\n- Taylor Nichols is an American actor best known for roles in Whit Stillman films including Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco, and Damsels in Distress.",
